    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not like real pain, it's just a burny feeling like after a big spicy meal. i'm 58 but i'm pretty active and i don't have any other issues. if i take a double dose of Tums or maybe some Pepcid, won't that just prove it's just reflux? i really don't want to deal with the doctor for something that's probably just diet.",
